# Guarantee Risk Scan Skill

When the user asks to scan A-share holdings for cumulative guarantee risks, monitor guarantee ratios, flag excess guarantee events, generate guarantee risk reports, or schedule recurring guarantee risk scans, use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/guarantee-risk-scan
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/guarantee-risk-scan/SKILL.md`.
2. For detailed API fields and risk classification logic, also read `.cursor/skills/guarantee-risk-scan/references/api_guide.md`.
3. Use the local `pandadata-api` skill for exact method contracts before any real API call.
